    "Description": "### Impact\n\nOrigin validation error in Microsoft Authentication Library (MSAL) for Node.js allows an unauthorized attacker to disclose information over a network. This affects the auth_code flow.\n\n### Patches\n\nVersion 7.1.0 and higher are patched.\n\n### Workarounds\n\nEnsure you pass in only the auth_code to to acquireTokenByCode",
